我就问，罗伯，你在哪儿？

160
00:06:36.410 --> 00:06:37.590
Are you in Los Angeles?
你在洛杉矶吗？

161
00:06:37.870 --> 00:06:40.410
Because the last time I talked to him, he was in Scotland.
因为我上次跟他通话时，他还在苏格兰。

162
00:06:40.850 --> 00:06:41.090
Oh.
噢。

163
00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:43.190
He's like doing some really fun stuff.
他正在做一些非常有趣的事情。

164
00:06:43.330 --> 00:06:47.410
But I talked to him, and I was like, Rob, what do you remember about Captain Jack
但我跟他聊了聊，我问他，罗伯，你还记得杰克船长

165
00:06:47.410 --> 00:06:49.390
and the whole Booze Cruise episode?
以及那整集“酒水游轮”吗？

166
00:06:49.550 --> 00:06:50.810
And this is what he said.
他是这么说的。

167
00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:51.150
Okay.
好的。

168
00:06:51.290 --> 00:06:54.930
He said, well, Ange, on a personal level, it was one of the first jobs I
他说，嗯，安吉，从个人层面来说，那是我离开《周六夜现场》后

169
00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:56.970
had after leaving Saturday Night Live.
接到的第一份工作之一。

170
00:06:57.170 --> 00:06:58.370
I was so nervous.
我当时紧张极了。

171
00:06:58.370 --> 00:07:01.930
I was really green, and I hadn't done much in front of a camera.
我真的很稚嫩，也没怎么在镜头前表演过。

172
00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:07.070
